        <span class="cta-cap"><button type="button" class="fd-btn fd-btn--white" data-trial-open>Try a free demo ↗</button><span class="cta-cap__note">Instant access · no call needed</span></span>
        <span class="cta-cap"><a href="/contact/" class="fd-btn fd-btn--glass">Talk to us ↗</a><span class="cta-cap__note">Questions? Our team replies</span></span>
      </div>
